  - dialog [ref=e478]:
    - generic [ref=e479]:
      - banner [ref=e480]:
        - generic [ref=e481]:
          - generic [ref=e482]: thermo-hydro-mechanical viscohypoplasticity
          - generic [ref=e483]: Available in laboratory
